SEQUENCE:1790358454
DESCRIPTION:原文只注明单个时间，未提供有效的起止时间
 区段。原文时间：15:30；此条仅作全天提醒，不占用具体
 时间段。\n\nPHYSICAL EDUCATION/HEALTH 40F\n\n体育与健康40F作业
 ：提交Gr.11 Part 3 PAP - Parent Sign Risk Factors - 作业。作业需
 电子提交，保存Word文档，回答所有问题，以打字形式完
 成（不接受手写或拍照）。提交前请确保回答详细，非
 单字回复，并包含正确签名。\n\n公告原文：\nFriday\, Septe
 mber 25\, 2026 @ 3:30PM Hello class. We discussed this a few weeks back in
  class about your first simple personal assignment. I am attaching this as
  a word doc and you need to save it\, then answer all questions and then s
 ubmit it back to me completed as a TYPED assignment and NOT hand written o
 r taking a picture of it. This is the start of using more electronic submi
 ssions that you will need to do in both university and also possible futur
 e jobs. Remember\, looking for details in your responses. Not just ONE WOR
 D responses. Think and elaborate on you responses. Remember PROPER SIGNATU
 RES The due date for this is\nFriday Sept 25th. Thanks and if you have any
  questions please ask. Mr. D Submit
LAST-MODIFIED:20260925T174734Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
